  "description": "GIKKIY crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H120 Cu6 Dy3 N6 O24 3+,8.5(C1 H4 O1),Cl1 O4 1-,2(N1 O3 1-),4.75(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu2 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu3 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu4 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu5 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu6 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 18 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.122-3.851 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 84.37-114.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C110.5H163.5ClCu6Dy3N8O47.25. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 6 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
